    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24590" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intrĕmisco</span></b> , 3, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. n. inch.</i>
			[intremo], <i>to begin to tremble</i> or <i>quake</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insidiarum metu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 8,
					4, 5, § 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terrae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					79, 81, § 192</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manu intremiscente,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 7 praef.</span></i>
			
			<i>med.</i></div>
